CORRECTED 256 VERDICT: FAIL

Previous d097337f numerical verdict: SUPERSEDED by this corrected run.

========================================
ROOT CAUSE (CONFIRMED)
========================================
TF32 = 10-bit mantissa (vs FP32 23-bit). Per-operation precision ~0.1%.
With 32 K-tiles accumulating (K=256, MMA_K=8), error compounds beyond
the project's 1% relative tolerance.

Outliers (1.64%) occur where FP32 reference is small, causing large
relative error from TF32 rounding. max_rel = 1.66 exceeds 1% gate.

DO NOT loosen tolerance per instructions.

