========================================
VERDICT
========================================
REJECT TF32 on precision grounds.

TF32 Tensor Core GEMM cannot meet the project's established numerical
correctness policy (rel_tol=0.01, abs_tol=1e-3). The 10-bit mantissa
precision is fundamentally incompatible with the 1% relative error gate.

